---

<section class="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">🗺️</span>
        <h3>Plan before you book</h3>
        <p>
          Add destinations, explore activities, and estimate costs before
          committing to anything.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">👥</span>
        <h3>Built for groups</h3>
        <p>
          Add trip members, assign roles, split expenses, and keep everyone on
          the same page.
        </p>
        <p class="feature-premium">
          ✨ Premium: invite members via link and sync the trip across everyone's devices
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">✈️</span>
        <h3>From planning to takeoff</h3>
        <p>
          Confirm your trip when you're ready — choose which activities carry
          over and your itinerary is built for you.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">🗳️</span>
        <h3>Vote on activities</h3>
        <p>
          Rate activities and itinerary events so the group's favorites rise to
          the top.
        </p>
        <p class="feature-premium">
          ✨ Premium: see each member's individual votes, not just the group average
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">💸</span>
        <h3>Track and split expenses</h3>
        <p>
          Log costs in any currency, split them across members, and see exactly
          who owes what with Settle Up.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">📋</span>
        <h3>Share your itinerary</h3>
        <p>
          Print or export a clean itinerary to share with your group before
          you leave.
        </p>
        <p class="feature-premium">
          ✨ Premium: generate a live shareable link with PIN protection
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">🧳</span>
        <h3>Packing list</h3>
        <p>
          Build a packing list per trip with reusable defaults. Never forget
          the essentials again.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">🌤️</span>
        <h3>Weather forecasts</h3>
        <p>
          See a 16-day forecast for each destination right inside your trip
          overview.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">📦</span>
        <h3>Import from a template</h3>
        <p>
          Start from an Excel template — destinations, activities, members, and
          budget all come with it.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">📱</span>
        <h3>Works offline, installs like an app</h3>
        <p>
          Add to your home screen on iOS or Android. Your data stays on your
          device — no account needed to get started.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .feature-premium {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--primary) !important;
    font-size: 0.88rem !important;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
